backend/data/*
# Exception: the tracked, re-seedable snapshot scripts/seed_reference_data.py
# reads from. Everything else directly under backend/data/ (e.g. raw USDA
# source files, if ever re-added) stays ignored - only this one directory,
# and everything in it, is committed. (A directory-level ignore like
# "backend/data/" can't be selectively un-ignored below itself - git won't
# even look inside an excluded directory - hence the /* + explicit
# re-include instead.)
!backend/data/seed
backend/uploads/

